<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est 95,000, Wk ago 105,000, Yr ago 102,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady with the mid-session Tuesday. Trade was slow for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
